                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today, I met with interim leadership at the Buffalo VA Medical Center to tour the facility and discuss the administrative failures that have caused unacceptable delays in cancer treatment for our veterans. \n\nI\u2019m committed to working with the VA and the House Veterans Affairs Committee to get answers, hold those responsible accountable, and make sure this never happens again. Our veterans deserve nothing less than the timely, lifesaving care they earned and deserve.",
