                "text": "This year\u2019s NDAA aligns with the @HouseGOP & Trump America First agenda:\n\u27a1\ufe0fImproves servicemembers' quality of life\n\u27a1\ufe0fCuts $31B in Pentagon bureaucracy\n\u27a1\ufe0fEnsures America has the strongest fighting force \n\u27a1\ufe0fBans taxpayer-funded transgender treatment for children of servicemembers",
