                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I was honored to meet with members of the Roswell Park Comprehensive Cancer Center and several families whose children are pediatric cancer survivors. We discussed various issues that impact the care and treatment of children facing cancer, including H.R.1262, Give Kids a Chance Act, which I am proud to co-sponsor.\n\nI was so inspired by these families & those who do the heroic work of caring for them as they battle this horrific disease. The health of our precious children will always be one of my top priorities.",
